      "size": [
        1000,
        180
      ],
      "widgets_values": [
        "☠️ PGFX STUDIO + LTX 2.3 MUSIC VIDEO PIPELINE\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTextFormatter → KeyframePromptScheduler → LTX GGUF — Per-segment prompts with overarching theme\n\nHOW IT WORKS:\n① GLOBAL THEME: ProjectContext + Stylist define song/visual identity → TextFormatter combines into overarching prompt\n② AUDIO: Load wav → SoundEngineer segments it → TimingMapAdapter normalizes timing\n③ PER-SEGMENT PROMPTS: KFS stores per-scene JSON prompts, prepends overarching theme, selects by frame_number\n④ LTXV2.3 GGUf: Proven pipeline generates video conditioned on the prompt\n⑤ ASSEMBLY: Editor saves each clip → PostMaster stitches final video with audio\n\nFILL THIS IN FIRST:\n• ProjectContext: song metadata, artist, genre, era, aesthetic\n• Stylist: base style, character tags, lighting mood\n• Producer: project name, resolution, fps\n• LoadAudio: your .wav file path\n• KFS: frame_number (0=first segment), keyframe_prompts JSON with per-segment prompts"
      ]
    },
