    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        10,
        1350
      ],
      "size": [
        950,
        200
      ],
      "widgets_values": [
        "HOW TO USE:\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1. Fill in ProjectContext (song metadata, artist, genre, aesthetic)\n2. Fill in Stylist (base style, character description, lighting mood)\n3. Set Producer project name and resolution\n4. Place your .wav in ComfyUI/input/ and update LoadAudio path\n5. Set KFS frame_number to 0 for first segment, edit keyframe_prompts JSON for your song\n   — Each key (0, 10, 20...) is a segment. Set frame_number to match the segment you want.\n6. Queue Prompt — TextFormatter combines theme+style, KFS prepends it to your segment prompt\n7. After rendering, increment frame_number (0 → 10 → 20) and queue again for next segment\n8. When all segments are done, set PostMaster force_render_now=true to stitch the final video"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "Note",
